// @@@ The added element's index is always valid and within the current size of the vector. For all indices i that are greater or equal to the added element's index and less than the old size of the vector, the element at position i+1 is null and the element at position i is null or the element at position i+1 is equal to the old element at position i.

--------------------
// @@@ The next element to be added should be null and the previous element should be null or equal to the previous element before the operation.

